    "message": "Check queue service while others move up on the shared generated Scenario\n\nThe tests built their own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder (seed 7,\none day) for 30 or 100 evacuees. They now pass the evacuee count, and a\nday for the long run, to the shared generated_scenario_with fixture\n(#88).\n\nThe three queue-progress tests join the other movement unit tests; the\nlong_simulation run with a hundred people stays here as the integration\ntest. All four still hold with the shared seed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
